{"4591470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hush Hush: Bootleg Spirits", "steam_appid": 4591470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591470/extras/bc14040aebb40057b4dca07d826b4f00.avif?t=1786641538\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591470/extras_big/bc14040aebb40057b4dca07d826b4f00.avif?t=1786641538 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run the Front Store</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, you manage a cozy small-town shop. Keep the shelves stocked, serve regular customers, and make sure everything looks normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your store is your cover. The real business happens behind the scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591470/extras/3d8b99544504022c78786e9831ead6f5.poster.avif?t=1786641538\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591470/extras/3d8b99544504022c78786e9831ead6f5.webm?t=1786641538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591470/extras/3d8b99544504022c78786e9831ead6f5.mp4?t=1786641538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brew in Secret</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ferment, distill, bottle, and prepare homemade spirits for a growing list of secret customers. Take phone orders, choose which deals are worth the risk, and deliver the right products before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591470/extras/eb19dc57e28ca9d71f9c1dc69a480f0a.poster.avif?t=1786641538\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591470/extras/eb19dc57e28ca9d71f9c1dc69a480f0a.webm?t=1786641538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591470/extras/eb19dc57e28ca9d71f9c1dc69a480f0a.mp4?t=1786641538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep It Quiet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every delivery can bring money, reputation, or trouble. Drunk customers may wander through town, police patrols may get closer, and one bad night can make everyone suspicious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a small-town store as a legal front</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew and bottle homemade spirits in secret</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take risky phone orders from NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver products at the right time and place</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build reputation with customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal with drunk customers, suspicion, and police patrols</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance profit, timing, stock, and risk</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591470/extras/bc14040aebb40057b4dca07d826b4f00.avif?t=1786641538\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591470/extras_big/bc14040aebb40057b4dca07d826b4f00.avif?t=1786641538 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run the Front Store</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, you manage a cozy small-town shop. Keep the shelves stocked, serve regular customers, and make sure everything looks normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your store is your cover. The real business happens behind the scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591470/extras/3d8b99544504022c78786e9831ead6f5.poster.avif?t=1786641538\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591470/extras/3d8b99544504022c78786e9831ead6f5.webm?t=1786641538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591470/extras/3d8b99544504022c78786e9831ead6f5.mp4?t=1786641538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brew in Secret</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ferment, distill, bottle, and prepare homemade spirits for a growing list of secret customers. Take phone orders, choose which deals are worth the risk, and deliver the right products before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591470/extras/eb19dc57e28ca9d71f9c1dc69a480f0a.poster.avif?t=1786641538\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591470/extras/eb19dc57e28ca9d71f9c1dc69a480f0a.webm?t=1786641538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591470/extras/eb19dc57e28ca9d71f9c1dc69a480f0a.mp4?t=1786641538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep It Quiet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every delivery can bring money, reputation, or trouble. Drunk customers may wander through town, police patrols may get closer, and one bad night can make everyone suspicious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a small-town store as a legal front</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew and bottle homemade spirits in secret</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take risky phone orders from NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver products at the right time and place</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build reputation with customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal with drunk customers, suspicion, and police patrols</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance profit, timing, stock, and risk</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Run a small-town store by day and a secret bootleg operation by night. Produce homemade spirits, take risky phone orders, deliver on time, and manage the chaos caused by drunk customers, growing reputation, and police patrols.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Danish, Japanese, Hungarian, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591470/6e4ee31408e34fd53ac5af51b9aff61380951d02/header.jpg?t=1786641538", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591470/ccf5ec9e09d19d3439f9014a3051fbf98f6e60e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786641538", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591470/ccf5ec9e09d19d3439f9014a3051fbf98f6e60e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786641538", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</